   "note": "2 electives from the Approved General Electives list (separate PDF, not enumerated here). At least 3 of the 6 total electives must be COGS. Verified against the UCSD Cognitive Science Dept '25-26 General Electives.pdf' (Updated 08-06-2025) at cogsci.ucsd.edu/_files/undergraduates/25-26%20General%20Electives.pdf. This is the enumerated Approved General Electives list; these are accepted as general electives without petition. 2 of the 6 upper-div electives come from this list. Constraints across all 6 electives: at least 3 must be COGS; only one COGS 160 may count; only one course from the COGS 19x series (190A/190B/190C/195P/198/199) may count, and only with instructor + advisor approval. Cross-campus online option PSYBEH 102C (Abnormal Psychology, UC Irvine) is included; UC Merced COGS 110 also listed (mapped to the standard COGS 110 entry). Individual outside-dept courses are enumerated rather than ranged because only these specific numbers are approved, not entire departments."
